hens. The door on the left opens into a summoning circle. I shouldn't have to say this twice.",tags:["Announcement"],likes:44,comments:23,time:"3d ago"},{id:"p6",authorId:"5",content:"Thornwood is finally clear. Camp dismantled, bounty collected. Spotted an owlbear on the eastern trail heading back — avoid the path for at least three days.",image:"/images/owlbear_sleep.jpg",tags:["Mission","Warning"],likes:11,comments:5,time:"8h ago"},{id:"p7",authorId:"3",content:"Grimshaw's weekly status: two fractures healed, one curse suppressed, Brálin's axe wound from the Keep is clean. He should rest but won't. You all know how this ends.",tags:["Healing"],likes:12,comments:4,time:"4d ago"},{id:"p8",authorId:"5",content:"Ladies night at the Tarnished Flagon — Vesper, Veylith, Seraphine, and I shut the place down. Brálin tried to join. We said no. 10/10 would repeat.",image:"/images/ladies_night.jpg",tags:["Morale"],likes:52,comments:17,time:"1d ago"},{id:"p9",authorId:"4",content:"Been studying the tome recovered from the Black Keep. The binding runes don't match any known school of magic — this wasn't made by a mortal hand. Proceeding with extreme caution.",image:"/images/tome_study.jpg",tags:["Research","Arcane"],likes:7,comments:14,time:"1d ago"},{id:"p10",authorId:"6",content:"Working on a new ballad for the Black Keep victory. Brálin, I need details about the gatehouse breach. For the song. Definitely not because it sounds completely unhinged and I have to know.",tags:["Morale"],likes:15,comments:6,time:"2d ago"}],Sue={Combat:"danger",Victory:"success",Quest:"primary",Mission:"primary",Warning:"warning",Announcement:"info",Healing:"success",Research:"neutral",Arcane:"neutral",Morale:"info"},$ue=[{src:"/images/tavern.jpg",alt:"Tavern celebration"},{src:"/images/beholder.jpg",alt:"Beholder encounter"},{src:"/images/mimic.jpg",alt:"Mimic sighting"},{src:"/images/gelatinous_cube.jpg",alt:"Gelatinous cube"}];function _ue(){const t=o=>eo.find(l=>l.id===o),[e,n]=D(new Set),a=o=